4. PROC MEANS data=ROCEst Mean Std P5 P95 P10 P90 P25 P75 ndec=4 (NumSamples=5000, seed=12345, method=urs samprate=1)
   ROCModel    N      Mean     Std      P5       P95      P10      P90      P25      P75      Min      Max
   Expert      5000   0.8157   0.0799   0.6773   0.9410   0.7091   0.9138   0.7648   0.8719   0.4183   1.0000
