5. PROC PRINT WidePctls (PROC UNIVARIATE output pctlpts=2.5 97.5 mean Std)
   ROCModel    BootMean    BootStdErr    95% Lower CL    95% Upper CL
   Expert      0.8157      0.0799        0.6488          0.9583
   Logistic    0.7698      0.0983        0.5654          0.9459

Title: Bootstrap Distributions of Area Under the Curve for Two Models
PROC SGPANEL data=ROCEst panelby ROCModel rows=2 layout=rowlattice; histogram Area; colaxis 0.4 to 1 by 0.1;

Notes: Bootstrap method=urs samprate=1 reps=5000 seed=12345. Area=AUC for event popind=0.
DeLong SE used for ROCAssociation 90% Wald CI. Percentiles use SAS PCTLDEF=5.
